# REC-FRAMING PROBE (prompt realism, Celestine): 20-movie slate, model
# picks 5, signal = Action fraction of picks (ML-100k's own flags = same
# ground truth as innate). Variants: natural / nodemo / a30_M / a30_F.
# One frozen Qwen job, ~2.9k generations (24 new tokens each). Checks to
# score on pull (registered in Q7): parse rate, corr(frac, innate),
# fraction distribution, gender-flip delta-frac vs the number-prompt
# +0.123. 2026-07-16.
# Submit: condor_submit_bid <BID> experiments/condor/at_eval_recprobe.sub
#
universe          = vanilla
executable        = /home/gsmithline/perfsim/experiments/condor/run_eval_rec_probe.sh

request_cpus      = 4
request_memory    = 64G
request_disk      = 40G
request_gpus      = 1
requirements      = (TARGET.CUDAGlobalMemoryMb >= 40000)

getenv            = False
environment       = "REPO=/home/gsmithline/perfsim CONDA_SH=/home/gsmithline/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh ENV_NAME=opdyn BASE_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct AGES=20,30,40,50,60 GEN_CHUNK=64 OUT_DIR=runs/pokec_gated_lm/demo_probe SKIP_DONE=1"

output            = /home/gsmithline/perfsim/experiments/condor/logs/recprobe_qwen.out
error             = /home/gsmithline/perfsim/experiments/condor/logs/recprobe_qwen.err
log               = /home/gsmithline/perfsim/experiments/condor/logs/recprobe_qwen.log

notification      = Complete
notify_user       = gabriel.smithline@tue.ellis.eu
max_retries       = 2
on_exit_hold      = (ExitCode =!= 0)

queue 1
